Under the direct supervision of the RFL Delegate, the RFL Admin Assistant supports in the implementation of ICRC Protection of Family Links (PFL) activities in his/her area of responsibility (AoR) in close collaboration with the RFL and Missing Field Officers in ICRC Yola Sub-Delegation and Mubi Office. S/he is mainly in charge of all administrative tasks allowing the PFL team to operate properly and field work to be planned and conducted effectively. S/he can thus be asked to travel to Mubi or Biu ICRC offices for administrative support, or other area of the AoR. S/he is also in charge of receiving visits and phone enquiries from the beneficiaries and responding to them, following cases with enquirers and supporting the team in field work, when needed.
